{"voice":"kokoro af_heart","speed":0.92,"pages":{"0":{"title":"Zech's Paper Airplane Parade","text":"","src":"p0.mp3","dur":2.55,"t":[]},"1":{"text":"“This is the fastest plane in the neighborhood,” Zech announced. He had folded his blue paper into a sharp, pointy nose, just like a jet.","src":"p1.mp3","dur":9.22,"t":[[0.18,0.5],[0.5,0.62],[0.62,0.8],[0.8,1.22],[1.22,1.66],[1.66,1.86],[1.86,1.94],[1.94,2.36],[2.88,3],[3,3.46],[4.16,4.32],[4.32,4.42],[4.42,4.64],[4.64,4.96],[4.96,5.14],[5.14,5.56],[5.56,5.82],[5.82,5.98],[5.98,6.32],[6.6,6.98],[6.98,7.24],[7.66,7.94],[7.94,8.16],[8.16,8.28],[8.28,8.5]]},"2":{"text":"Corey folded a wide orange plane. “Mine is built for smooth flying,” he said. At the top of the hill, Zech's spun into a bush and Corey's dipped into the grass.","src":"p2.mp3","dur":11.3,"t":[[0.3,0.46],[0.46,0.96],[0.96,1.14],[1.14,1.46],[1.46,1.88],[1.88,2.46],[3.2,3.54],[3.54,3.82],[3.82,4.06],[4.06,4.26],[4.26,4.52],[4.52,5],[5,5.58],[5.58,5.84],[6.42,6.52],[6.52,6.62],[6.62,6.82],[6.82,6.98],[6.98,7.06],[7.06,7.32],[7.66,7.88],[7.88,8.28],[8.28,8.6],[8.6,8.74],[8.74,8.94],[8.94,9.24],[9.24,9.74],[9.74,9.9],[9.9,10.16],[10.16,10.28],[10.28,10.54]]},"3":{"text":"“Mine needs to go faster,” Zech said. “Mine needs to stay up longer,” Corey said. They sat in the grass and studied their bent planes.","src":"p3.mp3","dur":9.2,"t":[[0.12,0.54],[0.54,0.82],[0.82,1.06],[1.06,1.18],[1.18,1.68],[2.08,2.16],[2.16,2.54],[3.22,3.42],[3.42,3.72],[3.72,3.98],[3.98,4.18],[4.18,4.36],[4.36,4.8],[5.14,5.26],[5.26,5.7],[6.12,6.32],[6.32,6.48],[6.48,6.68],[6.68,6.74],[6.74,6.96],[6.96,7.28],[7.28,7.56],[7.56,7.8],[7.8,7.98],[7.98,8.36]]},"4":{"text":"“What if we try one of your sharp folds and one of my wide wings?” Corey asked. Zech’s eyes lit up, and he grabbed a fresh sheet of paper. “Let’s build it together!”","src":"p4.mp3","dur":10.7,"t":[[0.12,0.42],[0.42,0.5],[0.5,0.6],[0.6,0.78],[0.78,1.04],[1.04,1.14],[1.14,1.24],[1.24,1.5],[1.5,1.88],[1.88,2.34],[2.34,2.5],[2.5,2.58],[2.58,2.72],[2.72,2.94],[2.94,3.6],[3.96,4.12],[4.12,4.48],[5.56,5.72],[5.72,5.96],[5.96,6.22],[6.22,6.42],[6.42,6.82],[6.82,6.92],[6.92,7.14],[7.14,7.38],[7.38,7.56],[7.56,7.9],[7.9,8],[8,8.36],[9.02,9.34],[9.34,9.5],[9.5,9.66],[9.66,10.04]]},"5":{"text":"They folded a new plane together: Zech's neat, pointed nose, Corey's broad, balanced wings. On the third try, it glided all the way to the treehouse.","src":"p5.mp3","dur":10.22,"t":[[0,0.38],[0.38,0.62],[0.62,0.86],[0.86,1],[1,1.28],[1.28,1.64],[2.54,2.72],[2.72,2.9],[3.24,3.5],[3.5,3.88],[4.26,4.64],[4.64,4.88],[4.88,5.5],[5.5,5.8],[6.8,6.85],[6.84,6.92],[6.92,7.12],[7.12,7.46],[7.82,7.9],[7.9,8.24],[8.24,8.56],[8.56,8.7],[8.7,8.84],[8.84,9.02],[9.02,9.1],[9.1,9.52]]},"7":{"text":"What Zech and Corey learned They wrote “Team Flyer” on one wing and “Built Together” on the other, and soon the whole hill was a paper airplane parade.","src":"p7.mp3","dur":9.7,"t":[[0.06,0.44],[0.44,0.66],[0.66,0.94],[0.94,1.1],[1.1,1.54],[2.34,2.39],[2.36,2.52],[2.52,2.92],[2.92,3.48],[3.48,3.76],[3.76,3.98],[3.98,4.26],[4.26,4.52],[4.52,4.78],[4.78,5.08],[5.08,5.46],[5.46,5.58],[5.58,5.84],[6.36,6.46],[6.46,6.66],[6.66,6.88],[6.88,7.04],[7.04,7.34],[7.34,7.58],[7.58,7.68],[7.68,7.94],[7.94,8.3],[8.3,8.8]]},"8":{"text":"3 big takeaways Word to know glide To glide is to fly smoothly and gently through the air. Shape Changes How It Flies Zech folded a sharp, pointy nose like a jet to go fast, and Corey folded wide wings for smooth flying. On their first flights, Zech's plane spun into a bush and Corey's dipped into the grass. Mix the Best of Two Ideas Zech and Corey put their ideas together: Zech's neat, pointed nose and Corey's broad, balanced wings. On the third try, their team plane flew all the way to the treehouse. Try it at home: Fold one paper plane with a pointy nose and one with wide wings, test both from the same spot, then fold a third plane that mixes the two.","src":"p8.mp3","dur":29,"t":[[0,0.25],[0.5,0.74],[0.74,